# Phase 2 of madgraph-ttbar-split: event generation from the pre-built
# process directory produced by phase 1.
#
# The run-card values below are identical to tasks/madgraph-ttbar-lhe's, seed
# included, so the two tasks are generating the same physics; only where the
# measurement boundary falls differs. Whether the events come out
# byte-identical across the two is an empirical question — check it with
# `llm-energy verify-events`, don't assume it.
#
# Prompt flow: the first `done` dismisses the shower/detector/madspin switch
# menu after `launch` (all off at LO); the `set` lines then edit run_card at
# the edit-cards prompt; the final `done` starts madevent.
set automatic_html_opening False
launch /work/proc_pp_ttbar
done
set nevents 10000
set ebeam1 6800.0
set ebeam2 6800.0
set iseed 42
done
